{title: Zindagi Kaisi Hai Paheli}
{artist: Manna Dey Salil Chowdhury}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C] [G],        Zindagi, kaisi hai paheli, haaye
[F] [C],        Kabhi to hansaaye, kabhi ye rulaye
[F],        Kabhi dekho maan nahi jaage,
[G] [C],        Pechhay pechhay sapnon ke bhage
[F],        Kabhi dekho maan nahi jaage,
[G] [C],        Pechhay pechhay sapnon ke bhage;
[F] [G],        Ek din sapno ka raahi,
[G] [F] [C],        Chala jaaye sapno ke aage kaahan
[F],        Jinhone sajaaye yaha mele,
[G] [C],        Sukh dukh sang sang jheley
[F],        Jinhone sajaaye yaha mele,
[G] [C],        Sukh dukh sang sang jheley;
[F] [G] [G],        Wahi chunkar khaamoshi,
[G] [F] [C],        Yoon chaley jaaye akele kahan
